# Trivy Misconfiguration Exception Policy
# Rule: AVD-AWS-0104 (Unrestricted security group egress to 0.0.0.0/0 on ports 80 and 443)
#
# Justification:
# Egress to 0.0.0.0/0 on ports 80/443 is strictly required for AWS Systems Manager (SSM) agent,
# OS security patching (Ubuntu archive mirrors), and Docker Hub image registry pulls across dynamic CDNs.
# Egress for DNS has been restricted to the internal VPC CIDR.
AVD-AWS-0104
aws-vpc-no-public-egress-sgr

